1011-- **Decision (Apurva, on the main thread's recommendations):** (o04) more than 10 digits that aren't a +91 / 0 prefix → show "That’s more than 10 digits. Check the number." instead of cutting silently. (o05) no passive offline notice on Sign-in; the notice shows only after Send OTP. (o07) the logo's 16 from the top is measured from the **safe area** (below the status bar / notch). (o08) Android back on Sign-in (the first screen) **leaves the app**. (o10) coming back from OTP via Change keeps the number and it edits normally (the first typed digit does **not** replace it). (o11) Terms → `https://www.truemeds.in/legal/terms-and-conditions`, Privacy → `https://www.truemeds.in/legal/privacy-policy` (placeholders, linked from the live Terms page), configurable from the server, not typed into the app. (o17) Sign up opens a browser **inside the app** (with a close button). (o18) nothing is remembered per number; an earlier answer shows again only after a new Send OTP. (o25) "New to Truemeds? Sign up" becomes one copy entry with a `{link}` placeholder. (o26) "Call Doctor Ops" on a device that can't call → open WhatsApp to the same number; without WhatsApp, show the number with a copy button.
